```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant PostSvc as Post Service
    participant Kafka
    participant Fanout as Fanout Worker
    participant FollowSvc as Follow Service
    participant FeedCache as Feed Cache
    participant PostDB as Posts DB
    
    Note over User,PostDB: Post Creation Flow
    
    User->>API: POST /api/v1/posts
    API->>PostSvc: Create post
    PostSvc->>PostDB: INSERT post
    PostDB-->>PostSvc: Success
    PostSvc->>Kafka: Publish {postId, userId}
    PostSvc-->>User: 201 {postId}
    
    Note over Kafka,FeedCache: Async Fan-out
    
    Kafka->>Fanout: Post event
    Fanout->>FollowSvc: Get followers(userId)
    FollowSvc-->>Fanout: [follower1, follower2, ...]
    
    alt User has < 10K followers
        loop For each follower batch
            Fanout->>FeedCache: ZADD feed:{followerId} postId timestamp
        end
    else Celebrity (> 10K followers)
        Note over Fanout: Skip fan-out, fetch at read time
    end
    
    Note over User,PostDB: Feed Read Flow
    
    User->>API: GET /api/v1/feed?cursor=...
    API->>FeedSvc: Get feed
    
    FeedSvc->>FeedCache: ZREVRANGE feed:{userId} cursor limit
    FeedCache-->>FeedSvc: [postId1, postId2, ...]
    
    FeedSvc->>FollowSvc: Get followed celebrities
    FollowSvc-->>FeedSvc: [celeb1, celeb2]
    
    FeedSvc->>PostDB: Fetch celebrity posts since cursor
    PostDB-->>FeedSvc: Celebrity posts
    
    FeedSvc->>FeedSvc: Merge and rank
    FeedSvc->>PostDB: Hydrate post details
    
    FeedSvc-->>User: {posts, nextCursor}
```
